<p>Feed on the pain you cause your foes.</p><p>For 2 turns you gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34%</acronym> lifesteal on all damage dealt.</p><p>The lifesteal will increase with your Spellpower.</p>